meta {
  name: Get Route By ID
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/routes/{{route-id}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  route-id: RrydfpW2u8QGhKYoH8LptV3JcJ5NCGQ5
}

docs {
  # Get Route By ID (HU36 - Consultar Información Ruta)
  
  Obtiene la información detallada de una ruta por su ID.
  Este endpoint NO requiere autenticación.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  - `id`: ID de la ruta (puede ser encoded o UUID)
  
  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "RUT_CON_EXI_03001",
    "data": {
      "id": "encoded_route_id",
      "origin_airport_id": "encoded_origin_id",
      "origin_iata_code": "BOG",
      "origin_airport_name": "El Dorado International Airport",
      "destination_airport_id": "encoded_dest_id",
      "destination_iata_code": "MDE",
      "destination_airport_name": "José María Córdova International Airport",
      "origin_country": "Colombia",
      "destination_country": "Colombia",
      "airport_type": "Nacional",
      "estimated_flight_time": "00:55:00",
      "route_code": "BOG-MDE",
      "_links": [...]
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errores
  - 400: ID inválido
  - 404: Ruta no encontrada (RUT_CON_ERR_03002)
  - 500: Error interno del servidor
}
